title 3-bit ripple-carry adder (gate level)
input a0 b0 a1 b1 a2 b2 cin
output s0 s1 s2 cout
# stage 0
X0 xor2 a0 b0 p0
Y0 xor2 p0 cin s0
A0 and2 a0 b0 g0
B0 and2 p0 cin t0
O0 or2 g0 t0 c1
# stage 1
X1 xor2 a1 b1 p1
Y1 xor2 p1 c1 s1
A1 and2 a1 b1 g1
B1 and2 p1 c1 t1
O1 or2 g1 t1 c2
# stage 2
X2 xor2 a2 b2 p2
Y2 xor2 p2 c2 s2
A2 and2 a2 b2 g2
B2 and2 p2 c2 t2
O2 or2 g2 t2 cout
